WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.899
The town has its land. Now, how will people get around?

2
00:00:04.969 --> 00:00:07.952
<v Posy>Posy: Make it easy for everyone to get to school!

3
00:00:08.022 --> 00:00:11.792
<v Florence>Florence: Easy for everyone? Then everyone needs a big, wide road!

4
00:00:11.862 --> 00:00:15.888
<v Florence>Florence: And a car park at the school gate. I am 77% sure!

5
00:00:17.158 --> 00:00:19.809
<v Dev>Dev: But Florence, we walk to school.

6
00:00:20.779 --> 00:00:23.830
Easy for everyone. Or just easy for cars?

7
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.695
Who did Florence forget?
